---
import Firm from '../layouts/Firm.astro';
---
<Firm title="About" description="Kixlogic is an HR services and consulting firm that recruits direct-hire talent for IT, engineering and life sciences, and builds AI-enabled applications.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="fw">
      <p class="eyebrow">About Kixlogic</p>
      <h1 class="display xl">HR people who <mark>build software.</mark></h1>
      <p class="lede">Kixlogic is an HR services and consulting firm. We recruit permanent talent for IT, engineering and life science roles, help growing companies run HR well, and build AI-enabled applications.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="fw split">
      <div><h2 class="display md">Our story</h2></div>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>Kixlogic began as a software company, building HR and business tools used on the web, inside Microsoft Office and on mobile. Building those products meant living inside the hiring and HR problems our users faced every day.</p>
        <p>We now put that experience to work for clients directly. We run direct-hire searches, we help companies put sound HR practice in place, and when a problem is worth automating, we build the software to do it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band soft">
    <div class="fw split">
      <div><h2 class="display md">How we work</h2></div>
      <div class="prose">
        <ul class="ticks">
          <li>We say what we will do, and we do it on the timeline we agreed.</li>
          <li>We only present candidates we have spoken to and believe in.</li>
          <li>We keep people in charge of decisions, including in the software we build.</li>
          <li>We tell you plainly when something is not a fit.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band navy">
    <div class="fw">
      <h2 class="display lg">Let's work <mark style="color:#0A1B4D">together.</mark></h2>
      <div style="margin-top:32px"><a class="pill" href="/contact/">Contact us</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Firm>
